stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Detect: watcher / attach / timer / CLI
    Detect --> Plan: profile P Behind (local copy, any deck,<br/>active or not)
    Plan --> Abort: any preflight check fails
    Plan --> Journal: staged tree hash == R, model matches,<br/>schema guard ok, rollback snapshot verified
    Journal --> Quit: plan.json written (fsync)
    Quit --> Abort: app won't exit within timeout
    Quit --> Swap: app exited
    Swap --> Relaunch: atomic renames done
    Relaunch --> Verify: app running and settled
    Verify --> Rollback: mismatch, on_verify_failure = rollback
    Verify --> Kept: mismatch, on_verify_failure = keep
    Rollback --> Notify: restore snapshot,<br/>quit / relaunch again
    Kept --> Notify: leave as applied, flag it
    Abort --> Notify: nothing touched
    Verify --> Done: re-hash L == R for every target
    Done --> [*]: journal cleared, B := R
    Notify --> [*]: journal cleared, logged
